# getquiz

## parameters
-        `id` : the id of the quiz you want

example
```
http://SITE_ADDRESS/api_getquiz.php?id=1
```

## return format
encoding: JSON (application/json)
structure:
```
Quiz:
        title: text
        description: text
        questions: [Question]
Question:
        text: text
        answers: [Answer]
Answer:
        text: text
        correct: boolean (0|1)
```


